<metadata><name>Galičica trail H-8</name><desc>H-8 is one of Galičica National Park's easier and shorter hiking trails. It runs 3.1 km from the H-9 junction to Elshani, climbing about 74 m and descending 96 m in the direction drawn, between 868 m and 946 m. https://galicica.finereli.com/trails/h-8/</desc><link href="https://galicica.finereli.com/"><text>galicica.finereli.com</text></link><copyright author="NP Galičica (trail lines), OpenStreetMap contributors (places, G-6)"><license>https://galicica.finereli.com/about/#license</license></copyright></metadata>
